               SCN('S3', "Works complete about 09:00 (60th NY), a good cover by 12 o'clock (brigade, Greene; the OCR reads 13), about noon (137th NY)", "Godard p.860; Greene p.856 (page image); Ireland p.866", 'documented', ['god_9', 'g_13', 'ire_noon']),
